WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.367
-As President Trump's allies
ramp up their attacks

00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:04.801
on special counsel
Robert Mueller,

00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:06.267
Speaker of the House Paul Ryan

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:09.601
has decided now is the perfect
time to get out of Washington.

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:12.133
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:13.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:16.534
♪♪

00:00:16.534 --> 00:00:19.601
President Trump is already
dealing with a mountain

00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:21.868
of embarrassing and potentially
incriminating stories.

00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:23.901
But just before we started
taping this show,

00:00:23.901 --> 00:00:27.400
we got another one about that
infamous, salacious allegation

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.434
involving Trump
and a certain sex act

00:00:29.434 --> 00:00:31.234
in a hotel room in Moscow

00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:34.734
thanks to former FBI Director
James Comey's new book.

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:35.634
♪♪

00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:37.567
-We're back with our experts as
we following multiple

00:00:37.567 --> 00:00:38.901
breaking stories, including

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:41.167
some explosive new excerpts

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:42.968
from the former FBI Director

00:00:42.968 --> 00:00:44.801
James Comey's new book.

00:00:44.801 --> 00:00:47.701
-This is regarding Comey
writing about Trump...

00:00:58.634 --> 00:01:00.701
And it goes on...

00:01:15.801 --> 00:01:18.434
-Oh, my God, it's real.

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:20.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:21.801
It has to be.

00:01:21.801 --> 00:01:24.634
[ Applause ]

00:01:24.634 --> 00:01:26.400
Why would you ask
the FBI Director

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:28.734
to investigate a pee tape
if you knew for a fact

00:01:28.734 --> 00:01:31.467
that pee tape definitely
didn't exist?

00:01:31.467 --> 00:01:33.267
That's like me saying,
"Can you make sure

00:01:33.267 --> 00:01:35.133
there isn't a tape of me in 1994

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:37.400
doing "Thunder Road" at karaoke
and then barfing

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:39.367
and then slipping on the barf
and farting?

00:01:39.367 --> 00:01:43.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.667
You know, I've always thought
the pee tape was real.

00:01:45.667 --> 00:01:47.100
And here's how I know.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.701
Back when the dossier
first dropped,

00:01:48.701 --> 00:01:51.000
Trump was asked about
the allegations on Fox News.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.501
Now, pretend you're a normal,
decent person

00:01:53.501 --> 00:01:55.901
who just got elected president
and someone asks you

00:01:55.901 --> 00:01:58.634
if there is a pee tape with you
in it.

00:01:58.634 --> 00:02:00.501
You'd say something like,
"That's insane!"

00:02:00.501 --> 00:02:01.968
or "What are you talking about?"

00:02:01.968 --> 00:02:03.300
Here's what Trump said.

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:04.300
-Nothing's ever gonna show up.

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:05.133
There's never gonna be a tape

00:02:05.133 --> 00:02:06.434
that shows up.

00:02:06.434 --> 00:02:07.701
There's never gonna be anything

00:02:07.701 --> 00:02:08.467
that shows up.

00:02:08.467 --> 00:02:09.934
Now, I would be very embarrassed

00:02:09.934 --> 00:02:11.767
if a tape actually showed up

00:02:11.767 --> 00:02:13.567
saying something like that.

00:02:13.567 --> 00:02:14.901
I would be double embarrassed

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:15.567
because I'm saying

00:02:15.567 --> 00:02:16.734
there is no tape.

00:02:16.734 --> 00:02:20.601
-"If it came out,
I would be embarrassed."

00:02:20.601 --> 00:02:21.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.868 --> 00:02:23.167
That's like if your girlfriend
said,

00:02:23.167 --> 00:02:24.300
"Are you cheating on me?"

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:26.200
And you said,
"Look into my eyes,

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:29.367
because what I'm going to tell
you is 100% true --

00:02:29.367 --> 00:02:32.100
It would suck if you
found out about that."

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:35.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:35.667 --> 00:02:39.133
Of course,

00:02:39.133 --> 00:02:41.734
this comes in the same week
that the FBI raided the office

00:02:41.734 --> 00:02:44.033
of The President's personal
attorney for evidence

00:02:44.033 --> 00:02:45.767
about the Stormy Daniels
allegations.

00:02:45.767 --> 00:02:47.968
In a response, The President
has openly floated

00:02:47.968 --> 00:02:49.968
the possibility of shutting down

00:02:49.968 --> 00:02:52.167
the special counsel's
Russia investigation.

00:02:52.167 --> 00:02:54.467
If you're a leader in Congress,
now would be a time

00:02:54.467 --> 00:02:56.667
to step in
and exercise some oversight

00:02:56.667 --> 00:02:57.667
over the administration.

00:02:57.667 --> 00:03:00.501
Or if you're Paul Ryan,
you can decide it's time

00:03:00.501 --> 00:03:02.133
to get the hell out of here!

00:03:02.133 --> 00:03:03.400
-The major breaking news

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:04.300
from Capitol Hill,

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.834
a seismic shake-up in Congress.

00:03:06.834 --> 00:03:07.834
The Speaker of the House,

00:03:07.834 --> 00:03:09.734
Paul Ryan, is telling

00:03:09.734 --> 00:03:11.267
his friends and colleagues

00:03:11.267 --> 00:03:13.968
he will not run for re-election.

00:03:13.968 --> 00:03:15.167
-Today, I am announcing that

00:03:15.167 --> 00:03:16.667
this year will be my last one

00:03:16.667 --> 00:03:17.968
as a member of the House.

00:03:17.968 --> 00:03:20.834
-No! You gave us Donald Trump!

00:03:20.834 --> 00:03:23.000
You should have to live with
him!

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.467 --> 00:03:26.000
Come on, buddy.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:29.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:29.367 --> 00:03:33.000
I mean, you can't just
clog up the toilet,

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.767
and then leave the dinner party.

00:03:35.767 --> 00:03:38.067
Stay here and get a plunger!

00:03:38.067 --> 00:03:39.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.968
Of course, for Paul Ryan,
this is the logical conclusion

00:03:41.968 --> 00:03:43.734
of his term as Speaker.
After all,

00:03:43.734 --> 00:03:46.067
he spent the entirety
of Trump's presidency

00:03:46.067 --> 00:03:47.868
ignoring the damage Trump
has inflicted

00:03:47.868 --> 00:03:50.400
on our political system
and pretending not to even

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.901
read his tweets or stories
about him.

00:03:52.901 --> 00:03:53.901
-I haven't put a second

00:03:53.901 --> 00:03:55.334
of thought into this.

00:03:55.334 --> 00:03:57.234
It's not on my radar screen.

00:03:57.234 --> 00:03:58.067
I'm not going to speculate

00:03:58.067 --> 00:03:59.334
on something I haven't read.

00:03:59.334 --> 00:04:00.567
-I didn't actually hear
the comments.

00:04:00.567 --> 00:04:02.400
I only heard about
those comments.

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.367
-I'm not familiar with exactly
what happened yesterday.

00:04:04.367 --> 00:04:05.801
I've been a little busy
with some other tasks.

00:04:05.801 --> 00:04:08.434
I don't know the specifics
of it. I really just don't.

00:04:08.434 --> 00:04:09.567
-Mr. Speaker,

00:04:09.567 --> 00:04:11.701
any comment on the Trump story?

00:04:11.701 --> 00:04:12.901
-Hey, how you doing, Alex?

00:04:12.901 --> 00:04:15.334
Good to see you. Thank you.

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:27.400
-I've decided I'm not gonna

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:28.601
comment on the tweets of the day

00:04:28.601 --> 00:04:29.567
or the hour.

00:04:29.567 --> 00:04:32.000
-You don't get to decide that!

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.868
You're the Speaker of the House.

00:04:33.868 --> 00:04:36.167
You don't have the luxury
of dealing with The President

00:04:36.167 --> 00:04:39.367
the way the rest of us deal with
a crazy person on the subway.

00:04:39.367 --> 00:04:41.467
"I'm gonna bomb Syria! Whoo!"

00:04:41.467 --> 00:04:44.067
"Oh, boy."

00:04:44.067 --> 00:04:47.334
[ Laughter, cheers,
and applause ]

00:04:47.334 --> 00:04:52.634
Is he gone?

00:04:52.634 --> 00:04:54.634
One thing Ryan
has always been good at

00:04:54.634 --> 00:04:57.267
is cloaking the politics and the
mind of the Republican Party --

00:04:57.267 --> 00:04:59.033
The politics
that led to Donald Trump

00:04:59.033 --> 00:05:00.334
and high-minded rhetoric,

00:05:00.334 --> 00:05:02.901
as he did once again
in his comments yesterday.

00:05:02.901 --> 00:05:04.701
-I'm grateful that we have
unified government

00:05:04.701 --> 00:05:07.133
that The President
with his victory gave us

00:05:07.133 --> 00:05:09.067
so we get all these big things
done.

00:05:09.067 --> 00:05:10.868
We'll have a great record
to run on.

00:05:10.868 --> 00:05:15.100
So I'm really proud of what
we've been able to do.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:19.100
When I took this job, one of my
conditions was that we aim high.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:22.634
-Aim high?
You support Donald Trump.

00:05:22.634 --> 00:05:25.934
Did you aim high,
or were you high when you aimed?

00:05:25.934 --> 00:05:27.934
[ Laughter ]

00:05:27.934 --> 00:05:33.434
Of course, when Ryan touts
his supposed accomplishments,

00:05:33.434 --> 00:05:36.434
he's thinking specifically of
that massive corporate tax cut

00:05:36.434 --> 00:05:38.968
that blew a nearly $2 trillion
hole in the deficit,

00:05:38.968 --> 00:05:41.501
a tax cut he once again
celebrated yesterday.

00:05:41.501 --> 00:05:43.400
-Probably the two biggest
achievements for me,

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:46.901
our first, the major reform
of our tax code

00:05:46.901 --> 00:05:48.968
for the first time in 36 years,

00:05:48.968 --> 00:05:51.033
which has already been
a huge success for this country,

00:05:51.033 --> 00:05:52.100
and that's something
I've been working on

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:53.567
in my entire adult life.

00:05:53.567 --> 00:05:55.834
-You worked on it your entire
adult life?

00:05:55.834 --> 00:05:59.300
It literally had last minute
notes scribbled in the margins

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:02.234
that no one could read.
It's like if I told my wife,

00:06:02.234 --> 00:06:04.634
"Honey, I painted a portrait
of you for our anniversary,

00:06:04.634 --> 00:06:06.868
and I've been working on it
every day for the past 10 years.

00:06:08.067 --> 00:06:10.200
[ Laughter ]

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:12.801
Could you tell it was you?

00:06:12.801 --> 00:06:14.868
So, Paul Ryan says he's been
working on this tax cut

00:06:14.868 --> 00:06:17.167
his entire adult life, and yet,
when he tries to brag about

00:06:17.167 --> 00:06:19.534
the supposed benefits
for average Americans,

00:06:19.534 --> 00:06:21.167
he bungles it,
like earlier this year,

00:06:21.167 --> 00:06:23.534
after Democrats said
middle-class taxpayers would

00:06:23.534 --> 00:06:25.467
only get crumbs compared to
what corporations

00:06:25.467 --> 00:06:26.801
and the wealthy would get,

00:06:26.801 --> 00:06:29.601
Ryan retweeted a story about
Hostess, the snack company,

00:06:29.601 --> 00:06:33.100
giving its workers free snacks
as a result of the tax cut.

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:35.601
Ryan added...

00:06:35.601 --> 00:06:38.033
Dude, you're bragging that
because of the tax cut,

00:06:38.033 --> 00:06:40.234
people will get free Twinkies?

00:06:40.234 --> 00:06:42.434
They want health care
and a livable wage.

00:06:42.434 --> 00:06:43.501
What's wrong with you?

00:06:43.501 --> 00:06:45.667
Look, let me put it
in Hostess terms.

00:06:45.667 --> 00:06:50.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:50.467 --> 00:06:52.367
Let me put this
in Hostess terms --

00:06:52.367 --> 00:06:54.634
If you're bragging about
giving away Twinkies

00:06:54.634 --> 00:06:57.667
while the deficit Snoballs,
you're a Ding Dong.

00:06:57.667 --> 00:06:58.601
[ Laughter ]

00:06:58.601 --> 00:07:01.467
And that...is a Zinger.

00:07:01.467 --> 00:07:03.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:03.968 --> 00:07:07.734
Ryan ran through a tax cut
that will cost trillions

00:07:07.734 --> 00:07:10.634
despite spending years lecturing
President Obama and Democrats

00:07:10.634 --> 00:07:12.434
about the deficit
in government spending.

00:07:12.434 --> 00:07:14.567
Ryan even lectured
then-President Obama

00:07:14.567 --> 00:07:17.000
about deficit spending
to his face when Obama

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.300
invited Republicans over to the

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:19.767
White House for a bipartisan

00:07:19.767 --> 00:07:21.100
summit on healthcare reform

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:22.300
early in his term.

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:23.634
-The full 10-year cost of this

00:07:23.634 --> 00:07:26.567
bill has $460-billion deficit.

00:07:26.567 --> 00:07:27.901
The second 10-year cost

00:07:27.901 --> 00:07:28.767
of this bill has

00:07:28.767 --> 00:07:31.267
a $1.4 trillion deficit.

00:07:31.267 --> 00:07:32.434
I think probably the most

00:07:32.434 --> 00:07:34.634
cynical gimmick in this bill
is something

00:07:34.634 --> 00:07:36.234
that we all probably agree on.

00:07:36.234 --> 00:07:38.934
-Look at Obama's face.

00:07:38.934 --> 00:07:40.567
That's the face of a man
thinking to himself,

00:07:40.567 --> 00:07:42.067
[ As Obama ]
"Only eight more years until

00:07:42.067 --> 00:07:43.868
I, uh, can go kite surfing."

00:07:43.868 --> 00:07:48.734
[ Laughter ]

00:07:48.734 --> 00:07:51.067
[ Normal voice ] So Ryan and
the GOP establishment revealed

00:07:51.067 --> 00:07:52.267
that everything they spent
eight years

00:07:52.267 --> 00:07:54.300
pretending to care about
was a scam.

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:55.601
Ryan wants to
be remembered

00:07:55.601 --> 00:07:56.701
as a serious intellectual,

00:07:56.701 --> 00:07:57.968
but in reality, he'll be
remembered

00:07:57.968 --> 00:07:59.067
as accomplice
to Trump,

00:07:59.067 --> 00:08:00.734
which is dangerous
because Trump is somehow

00:08:00.734 --> 00:08:02.801
becoming even more untethered,
if that's possible.

00:08:02.801 --> 00:08:04.868
This week, he's openly floated
the possibility

00:08:04.868 --> 00:08:06.934
of firing the special counsel
Robert Mueller

00:08:06.934 --> 00:08:09.534
and attacked him by name,
and yet Ryan insisted

00:08:09.534 --> 00:08:12.000
yet again yesterday there was no
need to protect Mueller

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.033
because Trump
would never fire him.

00:08:14.033 --> 00:08:15.501
-On the president, he has been

00:08:15.501 --> 00:08:18.067
openly talking about firing

00:08:18.067 --> 00:08:20.701
Bob Mueller, potentially firing

00:08:20.701 --> 00:08:23.267
the Deputy Attorney General.

00:08:23.267 --> 00:08:25.267
What are your thoughts on that?
-My thoughts haven't changed.

00:08:25.267 --> 00:08:26.767
I think they should be allowed
to do their jobs.

00:08:26.767 --> 00:08:28.367
We have a rule of law
in this country,

00:08:28.367 --> 00:08:30.000
and that's a principle
we all uphold.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.501
I have no reason to believe

00:08:31.501 --> 00:08:33.300
that's going to happen.

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:34.667
-Because I've been talking to
people in the White House

00:08:34.667 --> 00:08:36.033
about it.
-Talking to people

00:08:36.033 --> 00:08:37.868
in the White House? Who?!

00:08:37.868 --> 00:08:41.067
There is no one left
in the White House.

00:08:41.067 --> 00:08:44.901
True story -- If you hold
the White House up to your ear,

00:08:44.901 --> 00:08:46.901
you can hear the ocean.

00:08:46.901 --> 00:08:48.901
[ Laughter ]

00:08:48.901 --> 00:08:51.834
In reality, there's an organized
effort among Trump's allies

00:08:51.834 --> 00:08:54.200
in Congress and the right-wing
media to attack Mueller

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.868
and lay the ground work
for firing either Mueller

00:08:56.868 --> 00:08:58.701
or the man who supervises
Mueller,

00:08:58.701 --> 00:09:00.567
Deputy Attorney General
Rod Rosenstein.

00:09:00.567 --> 00:09:03.367
Now, that effort has already
been going on for some time.

00:09:03.367 --> 00:09:05.100
But the craziest thing
we have seen so far

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:07.300
from Trump allies
and the right-wing media

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.300
came last night from
Sean Hannity,

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:11.734
a.k.a. Cadillac Lurch.

00:09:11.734 --> 00:09:14.300
[ Laughter ]

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:16.601
True story --
whenever Trump calls for him,

00:09:16.601 --> 00:09:18.234
Hannity responds like this.

00:09:18.234 --> 00:09:19.501
-[ Deep voice ] You rang?

00:09:19.501 --> 00:09:21.534
[ Laughter ]

00:09:21.534 --> 00:09:24.868
-Hannity was responding to
former FBI Director James Comey

00:09:24.868 --> 00:09:26.501
who compared Trump
to a mob boss,

00:09:26.501 --> 00:09:28.734
and Trump apparently
spoke to Hannity beforehand

00:09:28.734 --> 00:09:30.467
and knew what was coming,

00:09:30.467 --> 00:09:32.801
because before Hannity's show,
Trump tweeted...

00:09:36.467 --> 00:09:38.601
Man, I thought Hannity
was Trump's hype man,

00:09:38.601 --> 00:09:39.934
but clearly it's the other way
around.

00:09:39.934 --> 00:09:42.567
Trump spends so much time
hyping Hannity's show,

00:09:42.567 --> 00:09:45.067
he's basically Hannity's
Don King.

00:09:45.067 --> 00:09:46.601
[ Laughter ]

00:09:46.601 --> 00:09:48.000
So, on the show last night,

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.534
Hannity decided to take
Comey's mob boss comparison

00:09:50.534 --> 00:09:53.133
and run with it --
Run with it right off the rails.

00:09:53.133 --> 00:09:54.434
-If Comey thinks Trump is

00:09:54.434 --> 00:09:56.534
a mob boss, is in his eyes,

00:09:56.534 --> 00:09:58.167
well, let's talk about a family

00:09:58.167 --> 00:10:00.601
responsible for actual crimes.

00:10:00.601 --> 00:10:01.601
We'll call it the head of

00:10:01.601 --> 00:10:03.801
the notorious political cabal,

00:10:03.801 --> 00:10:04.834
of course, Bill

00:10:04.834 --> 00:10:05.934
and Hillary Clinton,

00:10:05.934 --> 00:10:07.501
the Clinton crime family.

00:10:07.501 --> 00:10:08.734
Now, the next, by the way, we're

00:10:08.734 --> 00:10:09.701
gonna go to crime families.

00:10:09.701 --> 00:10:11.334
Let's look at the Mueller

00:10:11.334 --> 00:10:12.701
crime family.

00:10:12.701 --> 00:10:13.801
Last but not least,

00:10:13.801 --> 00:10:14.934
we have one other crime family

00:10:14.934 --> 00:10:16.067
we want to tell you about.

00:10:16.067 --> 00:10:17.868
And, well, this is near

00:10:17.868 --> 00:10:19.300
and dear to Comey's heart.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.133
We'll call it
the Comey crime family.

00:10:21.133 --> 00:10:23.534
-Wow, you know it's bad
when you're making less sense

00:10:23.534 --> 00:10:25.300
than Carrie from "Homeland."

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:27.400
[ Laughter ]

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:28.834
Now, with all of the talk

00:10:28.834 --> 00:10:30.434
of Trump potentially firing
Mueller,

00:10:30.434 --> 00:10:32.434
Trump tried to get out ahead
of the story today, tweeting...

00:10:44.701 --> 00:10:47.434
I love when you can tell
Trump didn't personally write

00:10:47.434 --> 00:10:49.100
one of his tweets.

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:51.334
That thing is all
lawyerly language

00:10:51.334 --> 00:10:55.000
except for
the "Unlike the Clintons!"

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:59.334
That was the one thing they
obvious caved and let him have.

00:10:59.334 --> 00:11:01.200
[ As Trump ] Can I call them
the crooked Clintons?

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:01.968
[ Normal voice ] No.

00:11:01.968 --> 00:11:04.300
[ As Trump ] Can I have
three exclamation points?

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.267
[ Normal voice ] How about
zero exclamation points?

00:11:06.267 --> 00:11:09.000
[ As Trump ] How about one?

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.534
[ Normal voice ] Fine!

00:11:10.534 --> 00:11:14.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:14.701 --> 00:11:16.601
Just as Trump
gets more dangerous,

00:11:16.601 --> 00:11:18.300
Republicans are either quitting
or egging him on.

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:20.601
Republicans in Congress
should be reining him in.

00:11:20.601 --> 00:11:23.033
Instead, when he calls for them
they answer by saying...

00:11:23.033 --> 00:11:24.400
-[ Deep voice ] You rang?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:26.234
This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:26.234 --> 00:11:27.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:29.634
♪♪

